# Unrelated projects used to share this working directory. They are gone as of
# September 2026 — every one of them is now in the repository it belongs to:
#   petty cash  →  gitlab.com/neopacific/eng1/petty-cash-management
#   books       →  github.com/sajeeu/books
#
# Fifteen of those files existed in NO repository at all, despite a comment here
# that called them "leftover duplicates". They are archived under
# docs/archive/2026-09-from-claude-workdir/ in the petty-cash repo.
#
# The patterns stay as a guard: if one of these reappears here it is a stray, and
# it should be moved to its own repo rather than committed to this one.
petty-cash-*
Petty-Cash-*
zoho-books-*
hr-dashboard-*
deliverable-response.md
REBUILD-DESIGN-SPECS.md
REBUILD-DIAGRAM-SET.md
SUPPORTING-DOCS-STATUS.md

# Local working state
.backups/
.claude/*
# Project configuration must travel with the clone — the whole point of the
# Claude Code migration is that agents, commands and skills are version-controlled
# rather than pasted into settings per machine.
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
# Local, per-machine state stays ignored
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/projects/

# Personal notes — not part of this project. Moved to github.com/sajeeu/books
# in September 2026; patterns kept as a guard against them reappearing.
chatgpt-books-history.md
entrepreneurship/

# end-of-day push log
.eod-push.log
